.TH NOTIFY-CENTER-VIEWER 1 "2026-10-27" "notify-center" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
notify-center-viewer \- browse and manage the Notification Center history
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B notify-center-viewer
.RB [ \-\-self-test ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B notify-center-viewer
is a GTK 3 application that shows the notification history recorded by
.BR notify-center-collector (1).
It can search across app, title and body, filter by app, category or unread
state, mark notifications read or unread, delete or clear entries, and export
the current view as JSON.
.PP
Launching it again focuses the existing window instead of opening a second
copy.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-self-test
Build the interface, print the number of rows and exit. Used by the test
suite; it does not modify the database.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/notify-center/notifications.db
The SQLite history, opened read-only.
.TP
.I ~/.config/notify-center/config.json
Optional settings.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR notify-center-collector (1)
.PP
The project home page:
.UR https://github.com/jt-at-home/notify-center
.UE
